  "label": "Meme creators and internet culture participants",
  "description": "The meme is designed for individuals familiar with internet meme formats, particularly ironic juxtaposition memes. The target audience likely includes users of social media platforms who understand visual humor, satire, and political commentary. The meme relies on cultural knowledge of political rallies (specifically Trump 2016), the symbolism of the 'freedom of speech' phrase, and the visual trope of the man in a beanie smoking a cigarette with hands over chest, which is a common meme template used to mock sincerity or performative gestures.",
